        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>FlavCity Vanilla Protein Smoothie takes an all-in-one approach by combining <strong>grass-fed whey protein with grass-fed bovine collagen</strong>. The current formula provides 25g of total protein and 10g of collagen per serving. Whey supplies high-quality protein for maintaining and building muscle, while collagen provides additional protein and amino acids associated with connective tissues. The formula also contains coconut milk, banana, and vanilla powders for flavor and texture. The addition of <strong>organic reishi and cordyceps mushroom powders</strong> differentiates it from basic protein powders, although evidence for specific focus or energy benefits from functional mushrooms varies by ingredient, dose, and population. The powder contains no added sugar and uses stevia and monk fruit for sweetness. At about 160 calories per 43g serving in the current Vanilla Cream formula, it works well as a protein-rich shake or snack, though a complete meal may require additional calories and nutrients depending on individual needs. </p><h3></h3>",
